SUMMARY:NAPS 2026: Paper submission (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:North American Power Symposium (NAPS 2026)\n\nPaper submission:
  1 Jul 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConference: October 11-13\, 2026\n
 Location: Houghton\, USA\nVenue: Rozsa Center for the Performing Arts\, Mi
 chigan Technological University\n\nThe call for papers states no timezone.
  This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly mean\, so the
  countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after it.\n\n58th
  edition. Papers are at most six pages and reviewed in stages\, with regis
 tration priced by submission date.\n\nCall for papers: https://www.mtu.edu
 /ece/naps-2026/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadli
 nes/conference/naps26
